// nvcc's options, one entry per option `nvcc --help` lists (CUDA 13.4), in its
// order:
//
//   NVCC_OPTION(ID, NAME, SHORT_NAME, VALUE)
//
// NAME is read after `--`, SHORT_NAME after `-`. VALUE is None for a flag,
// Separate for a value that goes separate or after `=`, Joined for one that
// may also be joined to the short name (`-Ifoo`, `-O3`).

